                                        "entry_id": "eac8fc15-f4ef-3058-9795-4167dcc405b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small unit of weight, variously:",
                                            "Synonym of dirhem: a former Turkish unit of weight (variously 1.5–3.5 g)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
